{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault","id":1158698,"title":"Demon: Storytellers Vault?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-11-14T16:27:02-08:00","id":1158698,"title":"Demon: Storytellers Vault?","content":"I'm wondering, can we expect Demon: the Fallen templates to be unlocked for the Storytellers Vault? Demon books are available for purchase via the Vault but there hasn't been much mention of anything Demon-related in any WoD media released so far.<br /> <br /> While we're at it might I ask is we will get Victorian Age: Vampire stuff made available too?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T17:47:07-08:00","id":1158722,"title":"","content":"The Storytellers Vault is run by White Wolf, so they set the timetable for which game lines are permissible. Onyx Path is not involved in those decisions.<br /> <br /> So far they've unlocked Vampire: The Masquerade and Vampire: The Dark Ages. I <i>suspect</i> they'll continue in that vein for a while, unlocking things like VTM LARP rules, Victorian Age, Kindred of the East, and other Vampire material.<br /> <br /> Given the relative popularity of Demon compared to other game lines, it's unfortunately probably fairly far down the list. We'll see.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b><span style=\"color:#800000\">Ian A. A. Watson</span></b><span style=\"color:#bdc3c7\">(he/she)</span><br /> <b>Onyx Path Community Manager<br /> Trinity Continuum Content Lead</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4-ianwatson","name":"IanWatson","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4_2.png","title":"Community Manager","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1512"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-14T19:07:46-08:00","id":1158743,"title":"","content":"Put another way: I expect Changeling and Hunter to get their Storyteller's Vaults up and running LONG before a Demon one goes up.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4418-tasti-man-lh","name":"tasti man LH","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4418_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1850"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T02:45:34-08:00","id":1158835,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>IanWatson</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1158722#post1158722\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Storytellers Vault is run by White Wolf, so they set the timetable for which game lines are permissible. Onyx Path is not involved in those decisions.<br /> <br /> So far they've unlocked Vampire: The Masquerade and Vampire: The Dark Ages. I <i>suspect</i> they'll continue in that vein for a while, unlocking things like VTM LARP rules, Victorian Age, Kindred of the East, and other Vampire material.<br /> <br /> Given the relative popularity of Demon compared to other game lines, it's unfortunately probably fairly far down the list. We'll see.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks, I have some ideas for VAV and Demon I think people will like, so I'll be keen to start working on them.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>tasti man LH</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1158743#post1158743\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Put another way: I expect Changeling and Hunter to get their Storyteller's Vaults up and running LONG before a Demon one goes up.</div> </div> </div> </div>Long after? Wouldn't Demon be the next release straight after Hunter? Since I assume the plan is to unlock them in the order they came out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T02:58:53-08:00","id":1158837,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>the_1990</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1158835#post1158835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Long after? Wouldn't Demon be the next release straight after Hunter? Since I assume the plan is to unlock them in the order they came out.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nope. While Vampire in the 1st gameline (1991), had this been true, Werewolf (1992), Mage (1993), Wraith (1994) and Changeling (1995) would have been out way before Vampire: Dark Ages (1996).<br /> <br /> And even, if true, Mummy (2001) will be coming out after Hunter (1999)...Demon only came out in 2002.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T03:47:07-08:00","id":1158856,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1158837#post1158837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope. While Vampire in the 1st gameline (1991), had this been true, Werewolf (1992), Mage (1993), Wraith (1994) and Changeling (1995) would have been out way before Vampire: Dark Ages (1996).<br /> <br /> And even, if true, Mummy (2001) will be coming out after Hunter (1999)...Demon only came out in 2002.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm wondering if they are first releasing the spinoffs of each gameline before moving on to others, IE; they release all Vampire spinoffs before moving onto Werewolf.<br /> <br /> There wouldn't really have many spinoffs they could release before moving on from Hunter, the only one I can think of is Dark Ages: Inquisitor. Mummy might also be released as a Vampire spinoff, since it apparently required the VTM rulebook, and wasn't an entirely stand-alone gameline.<br /> <br /> In any case I just hope it's actually on the list, and won't be simply forgotten about.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11522-the_1990","name":"the_1990","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:55:07-08:00","id":1159239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Boneguard</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1158837#post1158837\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Nope. While Vampire in the 1st gameline (1991), had this been true, Werewolf (1992), Mage (1993), Wraith (1994) and Changeling (1995) would have been out way before Vampire: Dark Ages (1996).<br /> <br /> And even, if true, Mummy (2001) will be coming out after Hunter (1999)...Demon only came out in 2002.</div> </div> </div> </div>WoD Mummy came out before Werewolf. So that'd be out before even Werewolf if we followed that trend.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1VN49Y7tH2ZV0l7Hx65RWX1ez-Q9Lst-8ZTyTJeCTpxM/\" target=\"_blank\">Sorcerer 20th</a> homebrew and my update to <a href=\"http://immortalthegathering.blogspot.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Highlander: the Gathering</a> for 20th Anniversary edition.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2414-theoutlander523","name":"theoutlander523","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"238"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-15T15:59:31-08:00","id":1159240,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>theoutlander523</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1158698-demon-storytellers-vault?p=1159239#post1159239\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> WoD Mummy came out before Werewolf. So that'd be out before even Werewolf if we followed that trend.</div> </div> </div> </div>World of Darkness: Mummy 1st ans 2nd ed did yes. Mummy: the Ressurection came after. So I would be inclined to go with actual line as oppose to World of Darkness one-off like mummy, sorcerer or mafia to name but a few.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Project consolidation:<br /> Rough Draft: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1230422-rough-idea-for-a-werewolf-mini-supplement\" target=\"_blank\">Dhole Shifters</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1212511-city-book-seeking-advice\" target=\"_blank\">Ottawa By Night</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1194394-fanon-tribebook-bunyip-wip\" target=\"_blank\">Tribebook Bunyip</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/353881-your-new-revamped-tribes?p=354143#post354143\" target=\"_blank\">Garou Variant</a><br /> In redaction: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1151956-%E1%B9%A3ill%C4%81nu-b%C4%93lu-lasombra-bloodline-feedback-request\" target=\"_blank\">Lasombra Bloodline</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3226-boneguard","name":"Boneguard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3226_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"477"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-11-17T21:11:55-08:00","id":1160114,"title":"","content":"It's a fan-written marketplace, this Storyteller's Vault, so I imagine White Wolf will open up parts of the vault as they think they can make money off of it.<br /> <br /> I prefer Mage: the Ascension, but I doubt most Mage material would sell as well as well-written Werewolf and Vampire material because most people I know that played WoD liked Mage least.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13680-baakyocalder","name":"baakyocalder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13680_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"353"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}